Package: LatencyA
Type: Package
Title: A Package for Latency Analysis in Epidemiological Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Fuyu",family = "Guo",email = "fuyuguo@hsph.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Zihan", family = "Qian", email = "zqian2@mgh.harvard.edu", role =  "aut"),
    person(given = "Molin", family = "Wang", email = "stmow@channing.harvard.edu", role =  "aut"))
Maintainer: Fuyu Guo <fuyuguo@hsph.harvard.edu>
Description: Used for latency analysis in epidemiological studies. The
    current package allows users to use splines to model the relationship between time-varying exposures and health outcomes.
    The current package also allows for automatic model selection for users.
Imports: Hmisc, survival, stats, MASS, stringr, future, furrr
